sleep 1.5
syl diver open
sleep 1
shot diver-today
syl diver view calendar
sleep 0.8
shot diver-calendar
syl diver view lists
sleep 0.8
shot diver-lists
syl diver list add - study
syl diver list add 1 maths
syl diver list add 1-0 homework
syl diver list rename 1-0-0 exams
syl diver lists
syl diver add essay due friday 18:00
syl diver new stretch every 2 weeks on mon and thu at 7:30
sleep 1
shot diver-sheet
syl state diver
bg wtype -M ctrl -k Return -m ctrl
sleep 1
shot diver-after-save
syl diver lists
syl diver set t3 time 16:00
syl diver set t3 repeat every 2 weeks on mon
syl diver set t3 priority high
syl diver set t3 colour red
syl diver move t3 1-0-0
syl diver focus t3 15
syl diver view today
sleep 1.2
shot diver-focus
syl state diver
syl diver unfocus
syl diver delete t3
syl diver list remove 2
syl diver lists
syl diver close
